  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> for which the vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>, are coplanar, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mn>80</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; is&nbsp;equal to&nbsp;"
  },
